Note on bundled content / 关于收录内容

The video prompts and metadata in `data/` and `prompts/` were made and shared
publicly by their original authors on X (Twitter) and remain the property of
those authors. Every entry carries the author handle and a link to the
original post. Takedown requests: open an issue or email support@workskill.tools.

`data/` 与 `prompts/` 中的提示词与元数据均来自原作者在 X 上的公开发布，版权归原作者
所有，每条均附署名与原帖链接。下架请求请提 issue 或邮件 support@workskill.tools。
